      ],
      "en": "and have cast lots for my people, and have given a boy for a prostitute, and sold a girl for wine, that they may drink.",
      "ko": "또 제비 뽑아 내 백성을 취하고 동남으로 기생을 바꾸며 동녀로 술을 바꾸어 마셨음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5285d07eb5ed291817cd026523201555dc4ab2cb7d1809e64b966a2894fef885",
      "translation_text_hash": "90ea2863817ed973a0fce92883efeeb0c781f065c79dd4a481f805eabd1fa553",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
